OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly fine but on the cloudy
OL,6,Fside at times. A few mainly light
OL,7,Fshowers are possible, with these more
OL,8,Flikely in the west, with the east
OL,9,Fbrightest. Generally very warm and
OL,10,Fhumid, but becoming breezier later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA fine evening leading into a
OL,13,Fvery mild night. Becoming cloudier
OL,14,Ffrom the west during the early hours,
OL,15,Falthough probably staying dry.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FMild and humid during the
OL,18,Fmorning, as a weakening band of rain
OL,19,Fmoves southeast. Becoming drier,
OL,20,Fbrighter and fresher later, with a
OL,21,Fbreeze and some warm sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
